OL,3,GNEWSAPostie threat neighbourhood loses
OL,4,Amail deliveries
OL,5,
OL,6,FDozens of households have had their
OL,7,Fpostal deliveries suspended after
OL,8,Fthreats were made towards a postie,
OL,9,FRoyal Mail has said.
OL,11,FThe company said one of its workers was
OL,12,F"threatened and prevented from leaving"
OL,13,Fwhen attempting to deliver to an
OL,14,Faddress in Sherburn Hill, County
OL,15,FDurham, on Thursday. This led to the
OL,16,F"extraordinary" decision to immediately
OL,17,Fsuspend services to 53 homes in the
OL,18,Farea, it said in a letter to those
OL,19,Faffected.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
