OL,3,GNEWSAPostie threat neighbourhood loses
OL,4,Amail deliveries
OL,5,
OL,6,FDurham Police said a woman had been
OL,7,Fquestioned and investigations were
OL,8,Fcontinuing.
OL,10,FRoyal Mail said it hoped to resume
OL,11,Fpostal services "as soon as it was safe
OL,12,Fto do so" but, in the meantime, people
OL,13,Fhave been told they can collect their
OL,14,Fpost from a nearby delivery office.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
